# SQLite persistence

- Database file path from `DATABASE_PATH` on mounted persistent storage
- Never commit `*.sqlite*` or bake DB files into images
- Enforce one application replica while SQLite is used
- Create parent directories on startup; run migrations before serving traffic
- Use a single-writer assumption; no multi-instance write sharing
- Prefer explicit schema migrations over ad-hoc ALTER in request paths
- See `docs/decisions/ADR-002-sqlite-persistent-storage.md`
